# Application architecture

- Default to Server Components. Add `"use client"` only for interactivity.
- Fetch data on the server when the page can render it there.
- Validate inputs on the server before any mutation or query that uses them.
- Keep business rules in one module. Do not copy them into a route, action, and client.
- Prefer small modules and reusable components.
- Handle errors centrally. Log structured fields (event, request id, user id, role). Never log secrets, passwords, or GitHub tokens.
- Prisma schema changes require a migration. Do not edit the database by hand.
